{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/2fa4f9897a8b618ecc86fb57d995c665.poster.avif?t=1751092252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/2fa4f9897a8b618ecc86fb57d995c665.mp4?t=1751092252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gathering materials</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather materials from plants, rocks, and more in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can even collect old cloth and cherries to make pink cloth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, rare materials can be hard to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/35d5df8f0ad2880ba483d32689174176.poster.avif?t=1751092252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/35d5df8f0ad2880ba483d32689174176.mp4?t=1751092252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decorate the house</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate your cute little puppet friend's house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can customize it with a variety of homemade furniture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's also a bunny cafe and a chick campground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/54a6ada059bb387cc012503cda74ba27.poster.avif?t=1751092252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/54a6ada059bb387cc012503cda74ba27.webm?t=1751092252\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Overcome obstacles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore different areas, each with their own unique features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And face the obstacles you encounter along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hard work pays off!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3836220?t=1751092252","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3836220?t=1751092252","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/0536cb8d7eee88f58fa382a92a81c195c3c72ff8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751092252","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/0536cb8d7eee88f58fa382a92a81c195c3c72ff8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751092252","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/2fa4f9897a8b618ecc86fb57d995c665.poster.avif?t=1751092252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836220/extras/2fa4f9897a8b618ecc86fb57d995c665.mp4?t=1751092252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gathering materials</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather materials from plants, rocks, and more in th